push r13
push rbx
push rbp
push rsi
push rdi
subtract_i32 rsp 136
move r12 r8
move r13 r9
move rbx rax
move rsi rdx
load_memory_u64 rax rbx none 1 0
call Vector_view
test eax eax
branch not_equal Invalid
compare rsi r9
branch below_equal Invalid
move edi ecx
call Memory_call
test eax eax
branch not_equal Invalid
load_memory_u64 rbp rsp none 1 112
move_u32 edx 4294967295
move rax rdx
shift_left rdx 32
or rdx rax
move rax rsi
shift_right rax 61
test rax rax
branch not_equal Target_limit
move rdx rsi
shift_left rdx 3
add_i32 rdx 39
branch below Overflow
